- core/stats/regression_groups.py: regression_with_groups — one or
  several variates and a group factor: sequential ANOVA in two orders
  (Tables 15.5, 15.6, 15.8), the four standard models for one variate,
  backward selection respecting marginality (F against the full-model
  ResMS, refit when ResDF ≤ 10), final model in the simple
  parameterization (α_j, β or β_j), intercept differences with CI and
  ratios on the log scale (Example 15.2), overlap warning, residual plots.
- New "multi_group" call kind: response, all numeric columns aligned by
  row and the group column (excluded from the x candidates).
- Tests against Tables 15.2, 15.5, 15.6, 15.8, 15.10 and Examples
  15.1A–J, 15.2 (Tables 15.1, 15.7 data added).

